  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/162/luckyskyblock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"581\" height=\"63\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此地圖為幸運方塊地圖，最多支援 2 名玩家遊玩。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這是一張僅含幸運方塊的典型空島地圖。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如遇錯誤或問題，請與我們聯繫。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/167/mapp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"68\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/169/map1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/173/map5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/168/map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>",
